      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCKDOWN (1) goes very well at the course with five wins and a placing from seven starts. Missed the frame latest (22.68) when fourth over 400m at Bulli in a Grade 4/5. Appeals as a leading chance in this. OCCULENT (2) was in the money last time at this track (22.70) in a Grade 5, finishing a neck third. Has four wins already from this draw. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. KUNG FU ETHICS (8) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when third (30.01) in a Grade 5 at Wentworth Park. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Can feature again. CYCLONE ETHICS (7) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in him.",
